    "content": "Hiring Momentum Continues in Private Banking!\n\nWhile there are active opportunities in Singapore, we are also seeing strong hiring demand in Hong Kong for Assistant Relationship Managers (ARMs) across multiple platforms and markets.\n\nCurrently, I’m working on several exciting mandates, including:\n✨Taiwan Desk – International Private Bank\n✨Greater China Desk – Swiss Private Bank\n✨EAM Desk – International Private Bank\n✨Taiwan Desk – External Asset Manager (EAM)\n\nIf you’re exploring your next move — or simply keen to understand the market — feel free to reach out for a confidential discussion.\n\nAlways happy to share more insights!",
