      "content": "Hi Connections,\n\nI understand many of you may be travelling, taking advantage of the long weekend - but if you have a moment, I’d appreciate you taking a look at some of the Assistant RM opportunities I’m currently working on.\n\nPlease feel free to reach out if you or someone in your network might be interested.\n\nNote: All roles are based in Singapore and require at least 5 years of experience in private banking or multi-family offices.\n\nCurrent openings:\n\n1. Private Bank (SEA market) - supporting a senior Partner alongside 2 other ARMs, focused on UHNW clients\n2. Multi-Family Office (MFO) - supporting 1 senior banker in a highly entrepreneurial, “open-sky” environment with strong exposure\n3. Wealth Management Platform - opportunity to manage and grow existing family office relationships\n\nHappy to share more details - just drop me a message.\n\nI’d appreciate it if you could share your CV when reaching out, as it will help me assess your suitability for the roles. Thank you!",
