    "content": "✨ Wishing Everyone a Prosperous Year of the Horse! 🐎💫\n\nAs we step into the Year of the Horse, may this new chapter bring you renewed energy, confidence, and momentum. \n\nTo my network and candidates:\nMay the year ahead be filled with exciting opportunities, meaningful connections, and breakthroughs that move you closer to your goals. \n\nWhether you’re exploring new roles, building teams, or developing your career, I look forward to supporting your journey in 2026.\n\nWishing you a year of strength, success, and boundless growth.\nLet’s gallop forward together! 🐎✨\n\n新年快樂、馬到成功、龍馬精神、財源廣進!🧧\n\n#LunarNewYear #Yearofhorse #wealthmanagement #privatebank",
